  "extra_setup": "Containers started with 'sleep infinity' on both nodes (models--lukealonso--MiMo-V2.5-NVFP4 hub dir mounted ro at /model_cache, repo dir at /workspace; worker gets an rsync copy of the repo). Then docker exec: recipe/apply-mods.sh (7 mods: drop-caches, ray-keep-node-nccl-hca, fix-prometheus-instrumentator-router, fix-mimo-v2-vllm, fix-mimo-mtp-patches, fix-modelopt-mixed-mxfp8, nvfp4-kv-diffkv) and 10 engine patches from patches/ on both ranks; Ray head (port 6379, --num-gpus=1 --object-store-memory=1073741824, after unsetting RAY_OVERRIDE_NODE_IP_ADDRESS/RAY_NODE_IP_ADDRESS) and worker join; wait for 2/2 GPUs; then on the head: source recipe/env.sh plus overrides and nohup bash recipe/launch-omni.sh. Weights downloaded with hf on the head at the pinned revision and rsynced to the worker. Passwordless SSH to zurih@10.0.0.2.",
  "notes": "Entrypoint is 'sleep infinity'; the server is 'vllm serve' run inside by launch-omni.sh with the args shown. Requires a dev vLLM build 0.21.1rc1.dev85+gd87ee1893 (CUDA 13.2) with mods; stock vLLM rejects nvfp4 KV / triton_attn_diffkv / MiMoV2OmniForCausalLM. VLLM_HOST_IP: head 10.0.0.1, worker 10.0.0.2 (RoCE IPs). NCCL iface/HCA from start.sh (enp1s0f1np1 / rocep1s0f1) override env.sh defaults (enp1s0f0np0 / rocep1s0f0) and are used on both nodes. KV pool 2,704,932 tokens (~2.70x at 1M). --enforce-eager (no CUDA graphs). start.sh has a relay/fix retry loop that may lower GMU/ctx/seqs on failure. Reasoning parser mimo is set but thinking is off by default. No LICENSE file. Based on tonyd2wild/MiMo-V2.5-TP2-1M-NVFP4-KV-2xDGX-Spark.",
